  "body": "Perched on the stunning Whangaparaoa Peninsula, just minutes from Gulf Harbour Marina, this exceptional freehold section presents a rare opportunity to secure a substantial landholding in one of the area's most desirable coastal enclaves.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 3,024sqm (more or less), the site offers a compelling combination of elevation, privacy, and scale - creating the perfect foundation for a bespoke residence designed to maximise space, outlook, and long-term value. Surrounded by established high-quality homes, this is a location where premium builds are not just expected, but celebrated.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of coastal living with the marina, ferry terminal, and scenic waterfront walks all within easy reach. Daily conveniences are close at hand, with shops, cafes, golf courses, and leisure facilities just a short drive away. With the upcoming Penlink set to further enhance connectivity, the future here is as strong as the setting itself.\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this size and calibre in Gulf Harbour are increasingly rare - making this a smart move for both homeowners and investors alike.\r\n\r\nTo view/download the property files please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/PAW1",
